  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1248D"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is10">
        <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e98">Caput 10</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1248D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_1@1-3">Vae qui condunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e112" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Haec plerique adhuc contra decem tribus dici arbitrantur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cum captivitatis, vel judicii dies advenerit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e126">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_5@1-2">Vae Assur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e134" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e137"><seg type="qs">Hucusque contra decem et duas tribus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et non solum captivavit, sed partim delevit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e148">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_7@1-2">Ipse autem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e155"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e156" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e159">Sic philosophi, sic haeretici, et sic persecutores Christiani nominis: cum Deus aliquos eis verberandos permittit, in omnes saeviunt, nec verberare, sed occidere cupiunt: et paucis superatis in omnes audaciam sumunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e163">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e165">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e167">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_9@1-5">Nunquid non principes mei simul.</quote>
            Ordo: Reges sunt mei principes, id est, mihi servientes: <pb ed="#P" n="1249A"/> multos enim reges secum adduxit, quos subjugaverat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e175">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e177" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_9@22-22">Damascus.</quote>
            Damascus est metropolis in Syria: hanc condidit Eliezer, servus Abrahae; in hac regnavit Rasin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e185">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_10@1-3">Quomodo invenit manus.</quote>
            Vox Sennacherib admirantis potentiam suam. Plene dicta complevit. Omnes enim civitates decem tribuum, et Juda et Benjamin praeter Jerusalem depraedatus est, et ipsius partem inferiorem, quam tradidit ei Sobna scriba.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e194">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e196">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e198">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e200" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_12@3-5">Cum impleverit Dominus.</quote>
            Subversiones, scilicet urbis, etiam obsidionem quando venit Rabsaces, et fecit ea quae in sequentibus commemorantur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e207">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e209">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1249B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e213" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_14@31-31">Ganniret.</quote>
            Gannire est vulpium, vel, ut alii, avium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e218">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e220">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e222">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_16@11-13">Et subtus gloriam.</quote>
            Dicit Hieronymus secundum Hebraeos, corpora interfectorum Assyriorum coelesti igne exusta, et in pulverem redacta, vestimenta illaesa; et venientes Judaei, vestium summitate arrepta, pulverem excutiebant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e228">
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e230" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/is10_16@11-13"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e232"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e233" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e236"><seg type="qs">Quidam volunt hunc regem significare contrariam fortitudinem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">tradunt enim Hebraei decem tantum de ejus exercitu remansisse.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e247">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_17@1-3">Et erit lumen.</quote>
            Dicunt Hebraei quod Michael archangelus fuerit, cui commissa est custodia illius gentis, sicut Daniel dicit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e258">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e260">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1249C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e264" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_18@1-3">Et gloria saltus.</quote>
            Carmelus mons magnus, fecundus arboribus. Quasi exercitus innumerus (sicut ligna sylvarum), et corpore et anima peribit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_18@11-12">Ad carnem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e277">Haeretici quoque, cum ecclesiastica doctrina illuxerit, et eorum decipula patuerit, ad tantam venient solitudinem, ut de saltu et infructuosis arboribus, et innumerabili multitudine, vix pauci resideant, qui eorum sequantur errorem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e282">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e284">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e286">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e288" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_20@1-5">Et erit in die illa.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e291"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e292" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e295"><seg type="qs">Cum Phacee et Rasin vellent venire</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed in Deo spem ponant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e304">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e306">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e308">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e310" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_21@1-2">Reliquiae convertentur.</quote>
            Secundum Josephum innumerabili Judaeorum multitudine occisa, <pb ed="#P" n="1249D"/> intelligimus paucos in apostolis et apostolicis viris esse salvatos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e317">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e319">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e321">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e323" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_22@14-15">Consummatio abbreviata.</quote>
            Perfectio eorum quae de Christo erant tam longo tempore ante praedicta tribus annis et dimidio completa.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e327">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e329" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_22@17-17">Justitiam,</quote>
            quia injuste occisus, mortem et diabolum juste vicit, et mundum redemit morte.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e334">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e336">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e338">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e340" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_23@1-2">Consummationem enim.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e343"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e344" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e347">Ad litteram. Fecit, quia tantam multitudinem praeter decem, occidit brevi spatio unius noctis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e351">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e353">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e355">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e357" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_24@24-28">Super te in via Aegypti.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e360"><seg type="qs">Captivitatis decem tribubus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cepit et subvertit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e369">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e371">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e373">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e375" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_25@3-4">Paululum modicumque.</quote>
            Hoc longo tempore post completum est; sed omnia saecula <pb ed="#P" n="1250A"/> aeternitati (in quo omnia praesentia sunt) comparata momentanea sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e383">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e385">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e387">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e389" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_26@15-18">Virgam suam in mare.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e392"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e393" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e396">Quasi: Antequam veniat super te, aggredietur Tharacam, regem Aethiopiae, et transibit mare Rubrum, et levabit virgam super Aegyptum, et sic cum multo exercitu revertetur contra Jerusalem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e400">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e402">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e404">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e406" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_29@1-4">Transierunt cursim. Gaba sedes,</quote>
            etc. Praeteritum pro futuro more prophetico.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e411">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e413">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e415">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e417" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_32@1-3">Confortamini adhuc dies est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is10-Rd1e420"><name xml:id="gom-is10-Nd1e421" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e424">Postquam Sennacherib tetendit in Nobe tentoria, volens mane expugnare Jerusalem, non cessavit usque in mediam noctem minari desolationem Jerusalem, dicens: En, ista sola civitas liberari de manu mea poterit?</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is10-Dd1e428">
          <head xml:id="gom-is10-Hd1e430">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is10-d1e432">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1250B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e436" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is10_33@1-4">Ecce dominator Dominus exercituum,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-is10-Qd1e439"><seg type="qs">Dixit pueri nomen de virgine nascituri</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et Libanus cum suis cedris succidatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
